{"label":"Added extname with no leading "." support to res.contentType)","sha":"a76fba57c49e1dfc641538521e48c86f35854843","short":"a76fba57","date":"2010-12-10T08:14:15-08:00","author":"Tj Holowaychuk","email":"tj@vision-media.ca","kind":"feature","files":2,"add":14,"del":0,"body":"For example now you may:

    res.contentType("png");

or

    res.contentType(".png");

both are fine now"}

{"label":"Added; partial lookup relative to view root. Closes #447","sha":"92c04cee1d170348b7b49898e86804b0d391d77a","short":"92c04cee","date":"2011-03-24T13:26:32-07:00","author":"Tj Holowaychuk","email":"tj@vision-media.ca","kind":"other","files":2,"add":4,"del":4,"body":"for example when nested deep, if you have a
partial located at ./views/messages.jade

